{
  "//": [
    "Lab config for the LRNLabDemo demo lab, derived from the real PCRLabsofAmerica.json.",
    "",
    "DEPLOY AS LRNLabDemo.json TO:",
    "  E:\\LRN-Data\\PayerPolicy_v2\\2026\\ReportsDashboard\\Application\\Configs\\",
    "All three apps (dashboard, ReportsApi, ReportWorker) read this one folder - the dashboard",
    "and API moved off C:\\LRN-Files\\... onto this path in commit e74e276, so there is one file",
    "to place, not two.",
    "",
    "THE ROOT PROPERTY NAME IS LOad-BEARING. Program.cs binds each lab file by a root section",
    "matching the lab key. Leaving it as \"PCRLabsofAmerica\" does not create a demo lab - it",
    "loads as a SECOND definition of PCR and the last file wins, repointing the real PCR lab at",
    "the demo database. It must be \"LRNLabDemo\".",
    "",
    "DbLabName is what makes the demo show data. The cloned database still carries PCR's own",
    "LabName values in its rows, but the config key is now LRNLabDemo - and almost every query",
    "filters on `config.DbLabName ?? <config key>`. Without DbLabName the demo would query for",
    "LabName = 'LRNLabDemo', match nothing, and every page would render empty.",
    "",
    "Paths point at demo folders on purpose. Left on PCR's folders the demo reads PCR's live",
    "CSVs, Excel exports and insight JSON - production data again, which the database scrub",
    "does nothing about. Copy the files across once from PCR's folders.",
    "",
    "Flags and rules are copied verbatim from PCRLabsofAmerica.json so the demo behaves",
    "identically in the UI. Do not tune them here."
  ],

  "LRNLabDemo": {
    "//DbLabName": "PCR's LabName as it appears INSIDE the cloned data. Do not change to LRNLabDemo unless you also rewrite LabName in every table of the demo database.",
    "DbLabName": "PCRLabsofAmerica",

    "DbConnectionString": "Server=ReportEngine\\SQLEXPRESS;Database=LRNLabDemo;User Id=sa;Password=<demo-password>;TrustServerCertificate=True;",

    "//paths": "Demo copies, NOT PCR's live folders. Create these and copy PCR's current files in once.",
    "ProductionMasterCsvPath": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Input\\LRNLabDemo\\",
    "PayerPolicyValidationReportPath": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Output\\PayerPolicy_Validation_Report\\LRNLabDemo\\",
    "InsightPath": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Output\\Prediction_Insights\\",
    "RCMJsonpath": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Output\\RCM_Insights\\LRNLabDemo\\Input\\",
    "Reports": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Output\\Coding_Validation_Report\\LRNLabDemo",
    "Avgs": "C:\\LRN-Files\\Automation\\LRN-Demo\\LRN-Output\\Averages\\LRNLabDemo",

    "//flags": "Verbatim from PCRLabsofAmerica.json.",
    "DBEnabled": true,
    "LineClaimEnable": true,
    "CollectionOutput": "table1",
    "EnableCoding": true,
    "EnablePrediction": true,
    "EnableForcast": true,
